00016: {"id":"UI67-U016","name":"招式/公共动画查找和请求","sources":[{"repo":"/workspace/pokemon-essentials","commit":"8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b","tree":"7589c800b61ba13a13040ed0d686979b80a84fd0","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/004_Scene/004_Scene_PlayAnimations.rb","mode":"100644","bytes":23190,"sha256":"ae97c79199a514f951cd96727e6a52d4163fc30ebbd6d5771db4fb165a420f2a","blob":"5df4c2c08d2bcca3063ad9fd104d33df37e75cb7","reader":"/root/ui_full","status":"FULL_READ","ranges":[[1,579]],"whole_file_read":true,"lines":579,"semantic_selector":"FindMove/Animation/Common/Core/BallBurstCommon"}],"facts":[{"id":"UI67-F016-01","assertion":"查找先try_get正规moveid否则用原id。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-02","assertion":"玩家查Move表。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-03","assertion":"对方先OppMove并标noFlip，再退Move。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-04","assertion":"明确move动画加hitNum。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-05","assertion":"默认类型动画选择category。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-06","assertion":"多目标或foeside category+3。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-07","assertion":"status且numtargets>0再+3。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-08","assertion":"类型表有18类各6候选，全部实读，作为回退身份数据而非宿主表现。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-09","assertion":"先同kind存在Move再查动画。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-10","assertion":"kind>=3且未命中再减3回退。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-11","assertion":"再类型userstatus候选2。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-12","assertion":"再TACKLE。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-13","assertion":"查找整块rescue普通异常返nil。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-14","assertion":"Scene.pbAnimation本身无showAnims门，门来自领域battle包装。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-15","assertion":"无animID直接return。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-16","assertion":"取targets首个。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-17","assertion":"animationsnil直接return。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-18","assertion":"OppMove以target/user反转并opptrue传Core。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-19","assertion":"saveShadows先记并隐藏所有影子。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-20","assertion":"yield正常返回才恢复；不是ensure。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-21","assertion":"Common空名直接return。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-22","assertion":"遍历首个name严格Common:animName命中Core。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-23","assertion":"Coreanimationnil直接return。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-24","assertion":"Core清brief后记user/target原xy。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-25","assertion":"以bitmapheight正常或默认128定焦点中心。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-26","assertion":"PBAnimationPlayerX.start→update/pbUpdate循环至done。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-27","assertion":"正常dispose后恢复xy与origin。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-28","assertion":"ballburstcommon用get_from_name。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-29","assertion":"只找到时建player丢弃user/targetsprites。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-30","assertion":"设targetorigin/start后入@animations，非阻塞。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-31","assertion":"缺动画不是可见空播放保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-NORMAL-0","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表NORMAL列0=TACKLE；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-NORMAL-1","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表NORMAL列1=SONICBOOM；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-NORMAL-2","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表NORMAL列2=DEFENSECURL；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-NORMAL-3","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表NORMAL列3=EXPLOSION；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-NORMAL-4","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表NORMAL列4=SWIFT；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-NORMAL-5","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表NORMAL列5=TAILWHIP；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FIGHTING-0","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FIGHTING列0=MACHPUNCH；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FIGHTING-1","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FIGHTING列1=AURASPHERE；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FIGHTING-2","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FIGHTING列2=DETECT；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FIGHTING-3","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FIGHTING列3=nil（本格无默认身份）；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FIGHTING-4","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FIGHTING列4=nil（本格无默认身份）；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FIGHTING-5","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FIGHTING列5=nil（本格无默认身份）；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FLYING-0","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FLYING列0=WINGATTACK；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FLYING-1","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FLYING列1=GUST；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FLYING-2","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FLYING列2=ROOST；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FLYING-3","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FLYING列3=nil（本格无默认身份）；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"},{"id":"UI67-F016-T-FLYING-4","assertion":"类型默认动画身份表FLYING列4=AIRCUTTER；身份不是动画槽或媒体存在保证。"}